      <figcaption>
        <span class="fig-what">The chain runs one way, and it ends outside the
          script. The re-arm line depends on the device-mode flag, and the flag
          depends on a person at the device. That is why a deferred item blocked
          the current build.</span>
        <span class="fig-limit">It does not show the resolution: someone has to
          pull the power at the device. That claim stays in the prose.</span>
      </figcaption>
